# supercronic crontab — all times UTC
#
# Format: minute hour day month dow  command

# Bot Spot (its own compose service) is the only live trader. Funding arb
# (spot + USD-M futures), the listing detector/sniper and the trend filter were
# switched off 2026-10-12 so nothing else trades the shared wallet.

# Funding arb (disabled): one minute after each USD-M funding window.
# 1  0,8,16  *  *  *   cd /app && bb funding-arb --submit-live

# Listing-announcement detector (disabled): fed the listing-sniper watchlist only.
# */2  *  *  *  *      cd /app && LISTING_WATCHLIST_PATH=/app/data/listing-watchlist.json bb listing-detector --detect-only

# Trend filter: disabled 2026-10-12. A backtest of the live config (top-1, 90d
# lookback, 30d rebalance) lost to holding BTC (2023→: +155% vs +399%;
# 2025→: -35% vs -12%, verdict no_edge, max drawdown ~69%).
# Re-enable only after `bb trend-filter-backtest` shows a real edge:
# 30  0  *  *  *       cd /app && bb trend-filter --submit-live

# Daily airdrop digest — 06:00 UTC (~ 09:00 Europe/Istanbul)
0  6  *  *  *        cd /app && bb airdrop-scheduler remind

# TODO Phase 2 enable on Pi: V2 signal snapshotter — every minute.
# *  *  *  *  *       cd /app && bb signals-snapshotter --once

# TODO Phase 2 enable on Pi: V2 weekly evaluation report — Sundays 00:45 UTC.
# 45  0  *  *  0      cd /app && bb signals-v2-report

# Phase 43 X insighter (paper only): x-signal snapshots every minute, weekly report +
# gate verdict Sundays 01:00 UTC. Inert until the x-insighter daemon writes signals.
*  *  *  *  *        cd /app && bb x-insighter-snapshotter --once
0  1  *  *  0        cd /app && bb x-insighter-report

# Daily SQLite backups — 23:15 / 23:30 UTC (~ 02:15 / 02:30 Europe/Istanbul next day)
15  23  *  *  *      cd /app && BINANCE_BOT_BACKUP_RETENTION=14 bash scripts/backup_db.sh
30  23  *  *  *      cd /app && BINANCE_BOT_BACKUP_RETENTION=35 BINANCE_BOT_DB_SETTING_KEY=POOL_DB_PATH BINANCE_BOT_DB_DEFAULT_PATH=data/pool-paper.db bash scripts/backup_db.sh
